  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Outside the bronze hall on San Cha Mountain, Tie Ruo Nan tells Fang Yuan that Tie Bai Qi is controlling the dog beasts and obstructing the group of experts, while Tie clan’s four old-timers confine the space outside the main hall.",
      "chapters": [
        396
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_tie_ruo_nan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is an old man with a head full of white hair and a third eye on his forehead that shines brightly.",
      "chapters": [
        397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beyond the four old-timers, Tie Bai Qi manipulates dog groups. At the hall door he looks down on the Gu Masters while he controls the dogs. He is an old man with white hair and a third eye on his forehead, a rank five enslavement path Gu Master, a Tie clan elder, and once Tie Mu Bai’s capable general, come out of cultivation under Tie Mu Bai’s orders to faraway San Cha mountain. Under his command the dog group unleashes several times the fighting strength it had before; he does not mind losses while blocking experts outside. Compared with when Bai Ning Bing sent out the dog emperor without energy to control it, he manipulates the whole battlefield more easily and shows enslavement path strength fully. When Xiao Mang forms Torrential Light Stream, Tie Bai Qi tries to stop it but can only reduce its impact a little. After Fang Yuan warps out of the hall, dog groups specially take care of him under Tie Bai Qi’s attention.",
      "chapters": [
        397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dog-groups-at-the-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_tie_mu_bai",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_xiao_mang",
        "move_torrential_light_stream"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan shouts that Tie Ruo Nan obtained a peerless Immortal Gu and is refining it, the crowd’s enthusiasm surges and Tie Bai Qi’s pressure intensifies.",
      "chapters": [
        398
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-news-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He takes off his hat and shows the third eye on his forehead.",
      "chapters": [
        403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "removes-his-hat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With Tie clan’s four old-timers by Tie Ruo Nan’s side, Tie Bai Qi is also present. She tells him they are a few thousand steps from the bronze hall with many dogs ahead and leaves the blocking to him. He takes off his hat, shows the third eye on his forehead, opens a black hole, and sends a white ape army in formation toward the bronze hall, telling her to go ahead while he blocks. With the apes covering for them, Tie Ruo Nan reaches the hall.",
      "chapters": [
        403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-ape-army",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Xiao Mang again pours Torrential Light Stream toward the blessed land, Tie Ruo Nan and others are in the main hall; Tie Bai Qi tries to stop it when he sees this, but the light river’s formation is already complete and he can only reduce its impact a little.",
      "chapters": [
        404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attempt-to-stop-the-light-river",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
